Package: novaos-apps
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: NovaOS Project <novaos@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pyqt6, python3-gi, gir1.2-flatpak-1.0, gir1.2-glib-2.0, flatpak, python3-psutil, python3-icalendar, libnotify-bin, pkexec, apt, novaos-base
Recommends: novaos-desktop, kinfocenter, pciutils
Description: NovaOS system applications
 The applications developed for NovaOS (Python 3 / Qt 6):
  * Nova Store – app store for Flathub (install, update, remove, permissions,
    ratings from ODRS)
  * Nova Updates – system (APT) and app (Flatpak) updates, update notifier
  * Nova Notes – Markdown notes with autosave
  * Nova Calendar – local appointments (iCalendar) with reminders
  * Nova Task Manager – processes, performance graphs, error logs
  * Nova Welcome – first-run assistant
  * Nova Help – offline help
  * About NovaOS – version and system information
